   "explain": "sin 0° = 0, so **no torque**."
  }
 ],
 "takeaways": [
  "**τ = r × F**, magnitude **r F sin θ**.",
  "Maximum at **90°**, zero at 0° and 180°.",
  "Direction along the axis, by the right-hand rule."
 ]
}